     "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear\r\nSir, </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I\r\nwould like to use shiny in web page that would show charts from a sqldatabase.\r\nI know how to connect to database in R, and show plot…</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">But\r\ni can&#39;t for the life of me get how to deploy this on web and do that from web\r\nbrowser. I am using Microsoft , and have enrolled in your beta  program.\r\nBut honestly, anything that is shown in your page dosen&#39;t work for me.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I\r\nunderstand i need to do some html (not a problem) :</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#823125\">html</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#823125\">head</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">  <span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">script</span> <span style=\"color:#cf4820\">src</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;../java/Shiny/jquery.js&quot;</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#cf4820\">type</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">script</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">  <span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">script</span> <span style=\"color:#cf4820\">src</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;../java/Shiny/shiny.js&quot;</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#cf4820\">type</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;text/javascript&quot;&gt;&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">script</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">  <span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">link</span> <span style=\"color:#cf4820\">rel</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#cf4820\">type</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;text/css&quot;</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#cf4820\">href</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;../java/Shiny/shiny.css&quot;/&gt;</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#4f76ac\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#823125\">head</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#823125\">body</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">  <span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span>HTML UI<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">  <span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">p</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">   \r\n<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">label</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span>Distribution type:<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">label</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">br</span> <span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">/&gt;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">   \r\n<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">select</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#cf4820\">name</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;dist&quot;&gt;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">     \r\n<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">option</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#cf4820\">value</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;norm&quot;&gt;</span>Normal<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">option</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">     \r\n<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">option</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:#cf4820\">value</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">=&quot;unif&quot;&gt;</span>Uniform<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">option</span><span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&gt;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas\">     \r\n<span style=\"color:#4f76ac\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#823125\">option</span>\r\n<span style=\"colo